The Git reader is a new native adapter informed by the public
Australian regulations corpus contract, not a copy of private legal files.
The corpus is maintained separately at
https://github.com/drfinlaymccall/australia-regulations
Its tools are Apache-2.0; its derived legislation is CC BY 4.0.
No corpus legislation text is bundled here. Runtime users must retain its
Federal Register attribution and verify the authoritative Register.

Related global-law fork: https://github.com/drfinlaymccall/global-law
Original upstream: https://github.com/lexifina/global-law (CC0 umbrella;
individual country corpora have their own terms).
No upstream global-law code is included in this plugin.
